Bundling modifications by this project:
  - wechat-cli: Windows init/contacts subset retained; other platform scanners and extra CLI commands omitted; secret-value diagnostic output removed.
  - wechatauto-replica: only the reachable accessibility routines are included. The local
    __init__.py and logger.py are project-owned minimal adapters, replacing eager
    package imports and upstream global logging side effects. Other upstream
    senders, OCR drivers and media/database modules are not included.
  - Original upstream LICENSE files are included beside each source subset.
  - Exact copied source hashes and revisions are recorded in vendor/SOURCES.json.

Local modifications (2026-11-13): remove unused platform/CLI/activation interfaces;
remove key/salt values and raw exception details from key-extraction output;
preserve validation and local JSON saving; stop the cross-verification iterator
after inserting a validated key. Original and local file hashes are retained.
